## Saving Jar

this file describes the saving jar feature.

1. the screen should have the 'Financial partner' title
2. the screen should have the 'Caixinhas' subtitle
3. the screen should have two buttons, one beeing 'Add Caixinhas' and the other one being 'Add a partner'
4. the screen should have the list of saving jars
5. to get the list of saving jars it should request the api in the endpoint `/saving-jars`
6. the list should have a card layout
6.1 the right side of the card should have two buttons
6.2 each card should show the name and the goal
7. screen layout is located at [list-saving-jar.png](mdc:layout-images/list-saving-jar.png)